{"id":"guul-draz","name":"Guul Draz","type":"location","aliases":[],"description":"Guul Draz is a boiling, sulfurous region of Zendikar, the home of proud and deadly vampire families.","pages":8,"first_seen":"2009-10-02","last_seen":"2020-09-25","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Zendikar","series":"Magic: The Gathering story profiles","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/zendikar-plane","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/zendikar-plane#:~:text=The%20Zendikari%20who%20endured,adapted%20and%20built%20alliances","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Zendikar\". Magic: The Gathering story profiles, Wizards of the Coast."}],"bio":{"summary":{"text":"Guul Draz is a boiling, sulfurous region of Zendikar, the home of proud and deadly vampire families.","cites":["zendikar-plane-e3"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/zendikar-plane#:~:text=The%20Zendikari%20who%20endured,adapted%20and%20built%20alliances"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Zendikar","series":"Magic: The Gathering story profiles","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/zendikar-plane","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/zendikar-plane#:~:text=The%20Zendikari%20who%20endured,adapted%20and%20built%20alliances","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Zendikar\". Magic: The Gathering story profiles, Wizards of the Coast."}]},"bio":[{"text":"Pages describe it as the vampire continent being devoured by the Eldrazi and as the home of vampires who raid the coast of Tazeem.","cites":["zendikar-plane-e3"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/story/zendikar-plane#:~:text=The%20Zendikari%20who%20endured,adapted%20and%20built%20alliances"],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Zendikar","series":"Magic: The Gathering story profiles","authors":[],"date":"","url"