c-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=%22Welcome.%20They%20come%20to,We%20will%20be%20accommodating.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e2","summary":"Enkindi, sent by Gideon, invites Drana's army to join Gideon's stand at Sea Gate.","participants":["enkindi","drana","gideon-jura"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":248,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":25,"quote":"\"Win. We can win. Many of you are still strong. We know what you can do in battle. Join us.\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=%22Win.%20We%20can%20win.,in%20battle.%20Join%20us.%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=%22Win.%20We%20can%20win.,in%20battle.%20Join%20us.%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e3","summary":"Drana shows Enkindi the Orphans' Brigade of children and proposes he fight with her first before she goes to Sea Gate.","participants":["drana","enkindi","melindra","the-orphans-brigade"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":248,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":42,"quote":"I'll leave with you to fight with Gideon at Sea Gate, if you and your warriors fight with me first.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%27ll%20leave%20with%20you,fight%20with%20me%20first.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%27ll%20leave%20with%20you,fight%20with%20me%20first.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e4","summary":"The vampires, mortals and kor battle the three Eldrazi hosts, with the sire as the key target.","participants":["drana","enkindi","the-vampires-of-guul-draz","the-kor","the-eldrazi-sire"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":248,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":52,"quote":"Mortal and vampire alike met the initial onslaught with a fierce savagery.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=Mortal%20and%20vampire%20alike,with%20a%20fierce%20savagery.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=Mortal%20and%20vampire%20alike,with%20a%20fierce%20savagery.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e5","summary":"Drana orders the Orphans' Brigade toward the sire as bait; Enkindi calls her a monster but leads his kor at the sire.","participants":["drana","enkindi","kan","t