es of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20serve%20no%20one%21%20I%20will%20be%20free%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e9","summary":"Drana releases the Eldrazi energy as a magenta sun that heals her army and destroys the Eldrazi, then collapses.","participants":["drana","melindra","the-vampires-of-guul-draz","eldrazi"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":248,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":98,"quote":"I belong to no one . . . but they belong to me.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20belong%20to%20no,they%20belong%20to%20me.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Memories of Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2015-09-16","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/memories-blood-2015-09-16#:~:text=I%20belong%20to%20no,they%20belong%20to%20me.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Memories of Blood\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 16 Sep 2015."}},{"id":"memories-blood-2015-09-16-e10","summary":"Drana orders her survivors to cross to Tazeem to Sea Gate, having learned the Eldrazi have somewhere to go back to.","participants":["drana","kan","the-vampires-of-guul-draz"],"location":"guul-draz","importance":"major","page":"stories/memories-blood-2015-09-16","order":248,"story_date":"2015-09-16","storyline":"Battles at the Brink","source":"wizards","paragraph":105,"quote":"\"Make